' Rejected: `detach` — "disconnect this branch from the flow".
' detach creates a dangling branch with no join point, which the
' Scenarios tab cannot express as "a path from start to stop".
' Rewrite: the detached work is either its own process (model it as
' a separate diagram / session), OR it ends in an explicit stop/end
' so Scenarios can close the path.
@startuml
start
:主処理;
if (通知不要?) then (yes)
  detach
else (no)
  :通知を送信;
endif
stop
@enduml
